class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/40px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/60px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/80px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gust of Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/40px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\">Gust of Wind</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 2 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lora%27s_House\" title=\"Lora's House\">Lora's House</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-65&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-89</span>: Reward by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lora_Bergauz\" title=\"Lora Bergauz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/38px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/50px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lora Bergauz\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png/25px-Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Portrait_Lora_Bergauz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lora_Bergauz\" title=\"Lora Bergauz\">Lora Bergauz</a> for saving her daughter during the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_Vanra\" title=\"Save Vanra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save Vanra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_Vanra\" title=\"Save Vanra\">Save Vanra</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The amulet also can be pickpocketed from Lora, or looted from her corpse if the party sided with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a>.</li>\n<li>Lora does <i>not</i> reward the party with the Amulet of Windrider if the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_Vanra\" title=\"Save Vanra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save Vanra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_Vanra\" title=\"Save Vanra\">Save Vanra</a> is not picked up prior to freeing Vanra from the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Hag's Lair</a>; she must first be spoken with at the <a href=\"/wiki/Basilisk_Gate_Barracks\" title=\"Basilisk Gate Barracks\">Basilisk Gate Barracks</a> to receive this item.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3241/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42790/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12912/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1507801/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   79.298      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   79.298      1 -total\n 33.20%   26.327     12 Template:Icon_text\n 28.35%   22.479     30 Template:Trim\n 25.61%   20.310      2 Template:SpellAction\n 20.35%   16.137      5 Template:Icon_link\n 16.30%   12.925     13 Template:Ifempty\n 14.75%   11.695      3 Template:Uid\n 13.89%   11.017      2 Template:Spell_action/format\n 11.50%    9.120      1 Template:WeaponType\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9509-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195515 and revision id 393321. Rendering w